<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_paragraph"><a href="#S6.SS0.SSS0.Px5" title="In 6 Further Analysis ‣ PAL-UI: Planning with Active Look-back for Vision-Based GUI Agents" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">Analysis of Retrieval Behavior.</span></a></li>
</ol></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_section"><a href="#S7" title="In PAL-UI: Planning with Active Look-back for Vision-Based GUI Agents" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">7 </span>Conclusion</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_section"><a href="#S8" title="In PAL-UI: Planning with Active Look-back for Vision-Based GUI Agents" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">8 </span>ETHICS STATEMENT</span></a></li>
